OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'startled' after garden fell  
OL,4,Ainto sinkhole                          
OL,6,FA man has said he was "startled and    
OL,7,Fshocked" to wake up to find his front  
OL,8,Fgarden had collapsed into a sinkhole.  
OL,10,FSam Colin-Jones' property was one of   
OL,11,Fthree homes that needed to be evacuated
OL,12,Fafter the sinkhole opened up in        
OL,13,FHalstead Way, in Allington, Maidstone, 
OL,14,Fon Thursday morning.                   
OL,16,FThe hole measured about 9ft deep (3m)  
OL,17,Fand 32ft (10m) long. No injuries were  
OL,18,Freported, Kent Fire and Rescue Service 
OL,19,F(KFRS) said.                           
