OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'startled' after garden fell  
OL,4,Ainto sinkhole                          
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Kent at the scene
OL,7,Fon Monday morning, Colin-Jones said:   
OL,8,F"It happened at 01:00 GMT. Waking up to
OL,9,F'Where has my front garden gone?' is   
OL,10,Fnot something you want to be waking up 
OL,11,Fto."                                   
